{"3992210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astra", "steam_appid": 3992210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/fe1c1d5e87c96808d5006721f53e9240.avif?t=1767957574\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras_big/fe1c1d5e87c96808d5006721f53e9240.webp?t=1767957574 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your ticket to the stars.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 TURN YOUR HOME INTO A SPACESHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mixed reality journey that transforms your room into a spaceship for a mission to the deepest corners of the cosmos. Following the research of your late astrobiologist mother, travel in space and visit planets and their dark moons in the search for life. You'll try to uncover the mystery of life in the universe and make sense of your loss and grief. ASTRA blends storytelling, virtual reality and interactive design with stunning environments, guiding you through a deeply personal yet universal adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.poster.avif?t=1767957574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.webm?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.mp4?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 DISCOVER STUNNING LANDSCAPES &amp; SEARCH FOR LIFE IN THE UNIVERSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stunning landscapes on Jupiter, Titan, Europa and more, all from the comfort of your room. Visit planets &amp; moons and analyze their chemical signature to find the key ingredient for life in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/d9620765a2ba9db1915a3c1d772b8213.poster.avif?t=1767957574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/d9620765a2ba9db1915a3c1d772b8213.webm?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/d9620765a2ba9db1915a3c1d772b8213.mp4?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐Enjoy the fusion of storytelling, interactive design and beautiful cinematic sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆SXSW World Premiere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directed by the visionary Eliza McNitt behind the acclaimed virtual experience &quot;Spheres&quot;, produced by the creative studio behind the Emmy-winning &quot;Madrid Noir&quot;, and featuring the voice of Taylour Paige, ASTRA will open a breathtaking window to the cosmos right from your own home. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/fe1c1d5e87c96808d5006721f53e9240.avif?t=1767957574\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras_big/fe1c1d5e87c96808d5006721f53e9240.webp?t=1767957574 width=1560 height=535 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your ticket to the stars.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 TURN YOUR HOME INTO A SPACESHIP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a mixed reality journey that transforms your room into a spaceship for a mission to the deepest corners of the cosmos. Following the research of your late astrobiologist mother, travel in space and visit planets and their dark moons in the search for life. You'll try to uncover the mystery of life in the universe and make sense of your loss and grief. ASTRA blends storytelling, virtual reality and interactive design with stunning environments, guiding you through a deeply personal yet universal adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.poster.avif?t=1767957574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.webm?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/c85bfc72525ae0abab1fce88aff491e1.mp4?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 DISCOVER STUNNING LANDSCAPES &amp; SEARCH FOR LIFE IN THE UNIVERSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover stunning landscapes on Jupiter, Titan, Europa and more, all from the comfort of your room. Visit planets &amp; moons and analyze their chemical signature to find the key ingredient for life in the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/d9620765a2ba9db1915a3c1d772b8213.poster.avif?t=1767957574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992210/extras/d9620765a2ba9db1915a3c1d772b8213.webm?t=1767957574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\